  "description": "Gravity oil-water separators at the head of an industrial effluent train: long baffled API-type basins designed to API 421, or corrugated/tilted plate pack (CPI/PPI) coalescers that reach smaller droplets in a smaller footprint. Skimmed oil is recovered; the oily water flows on to flotation and biological treatment. Primary source: https://oil-water-separators.com/when-why-we-started/the-technical-implications-of-api-421",
  "applications": [
    "refinery and petrochemical effluent trains",
    "produced-water de-oiling",
    "terminal and tank-farm runoff"
  ],
